<reference id="api_ilocalspatialaudioengine_release_ilocalspatialaudioengine">
    <title><ph keyref="release_ILocalSpatialAudioEngine"/></title>
    <shortdesc id="short"><ph id="shortdesc" props="cpp">Releases all resources of <xref keyref="ILocalSpatialAudioEngine"/>.</ph><ph id="shortdesc" props="android">Destroys the <xref keyref="ILocalSpatialAudioEngine"/> instance.</ph><ph id="shortdesc" props="ios mac">Destroys .</ph></shortdesc>
    <prolog>
        <metadata>
            <keywords>
                <indexterm keyref="release_ILocalSpatialAudioEngine"/>
            </keywords>
        </metadata>
    </prolog>
    <refbody>
        <section id="prototype">
            <p outputclass="codeblock">
                <codeblock props="cpp" outputclass="language-cpp">virtual void release() = 0;</codeblock>
                <codeblock props="android" outputclass="language-java">public static synchronized void destroy()</codeblock>
            <codeblock props="ios mac" outputclass="language-objectivec">+ (void)destroy;</codeblock>
            <codeblock props="ios" outputclass="language-objectivec">+ (void)destroy NS_SWIFT_NAME(destroy());</codeblock>
                </p>
        </section>
        <section id="detailed_desc" deliveryTarget="details" otherprops="no-title">
            <p props="cpp">Call this method to release all resources under <xref keyref="ILocalSpatialAudioEngine"/>. After calling this method, you can no longer use any APIs under <xref keyref="ILocalSpatialAudioEngine"/>.</p>
            <p props="android">After calling this method, you can no longer use any API under <xref keyref="ILocalSpatialAudioEngine"/>. To use spatial audio features again, wait until the <xref keyref="release_ILocalSpatialAudioEngine"/> method completes, then call <xref keyref="initialize_ILocalSpatialAudioEngine"/> to create a new <xref keyref="ILocalSpatialAudioEngine"/> instance.</p>
            <note props="cpp">Call this method before calling the <xref keyref="release_ILocalSpatialAudioEngine"/> method.</note>
            <note props="android">Call this method before calling the <xref keyref="release_ILocalSpatialAudioEngine"/> method.</note>
        <p props="ios mac">This method releases all resources under <apiname keyref="ILocalSpatialAudioEngine"/>. When the user does not need to use the spatial audio effect, you can call this method to release resources for other operations.</p>
            <p props="ios mac">After calling this method, you can no longer use any of the APIs under <apiname keyref="ILocalSpatialAudioEngine"/>. To use the spatial audio effect again, you need to wait until the <apiname keyref="release_ILocalSpatialAudioEngine"/> method execution to complete before calling <xref keyref="initialize_ILocalSpatialAudioEngine"/> to create a new <apiname keyref="ILocalSpatialAudioEngine"/>.<note>Call this method before the <xref keyref="release"/> method under <xref keyref="IRtcEngine"/>.</note></p>
        </section>
    </refbody>
</reference>
